{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe Rhine is a fine sight, though the heat is stifling. I reached Koblenz yesterday, took a bath to cool off, and have been writing to you since. The journey through Kassel with the Beers was pleasant enough; they are a decent sort, if a bit stiff. Marburg was a quick stop to see Suabedissen—he is older now, and his mind, while still sharp, moves with a certain slowness that reminds me of our own aging. In Wetzlar, Schulz’s wife made an excellent dinner. The wine was good, the bread fresh, and the conversation light. I paid two thalers for the coach to Koblenz, which I consider fair for the distance, though the driver was a fool who nearly lost a wheel on the cobblestones.\n\nKarl and Immanuel must be in their studies. Tell them to keep their heads down and their spirits up. Ludwig is quiet, I hope. I am tired but content. The air here is thick, but the view from the castle is worth the climb.\n\nYours,\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795219422,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":237,"prompt_tokens":1128,"total_tokens":1365,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-ZUjycjIsFxL3QvuUzjj1nBvgSlmtfUTK","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":1128,"prompt_ms":1267.066,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.123285460992908,"prompt_per_second":890.2456541332496,"predicted_n":237,"predicted_ms":5627.266,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.844347457627116,"predicted_per_second":41.93866079904522}}